{"title":"1992 OIM Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_OIM_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For each positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1a2b6b7c193f9ba2b2134a59f1da5addcfbc98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> be the last digit of the number. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/5/1c588e4c468229395de6ba9376be96044d26a50e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+3+\\cdots +n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"150\" height=\"15\" />. Calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/5/765a04a1edad655c76909b7bb5085c735b96b69a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 + a_2 + a_3 + \\cdots + a_{1992}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"200\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_OIM_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/1/b01968490e95502ee7c9f700787fe60b2b0cce79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n=\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}\\text{ mod } 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"40\" /> \n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be integers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/7/cb745f62ddf5625f47a60b8976c60faebcf74f43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/6/5e66dcf391f47e8717dc1db5e89789927505f23a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le p \\le 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/e/18ef309cc15460d3c62ae507d2dfbc622bdf4a8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{20k+p}=\\frac{(20k+p)(20k+p+1)}{2}\\text{ mod } 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"318\" height=\"40\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c7cb70e422484ace0de8b63240e4fe36c33b78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{20k+p}=\\frac{400k^2+20k(p+1)+20kp+p(p+1)}{2}\\text{ mod } 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"435\" height=\"41\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/7/7c7fa09a73a4cbaa8ca85302289dd4cac33891bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{20k+p}=\\left(10(20k^2+k(p+1)+kp)+ \\frac{p(p+1)}{2} \\right)\\text{ mod } 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"451\" height=\"45\" /> \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/6/93695e00fcca3be544dcb690327ddcc43c84cc98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10(20k^2+k(p+1)+kp)\\text{ mod } 10=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"292\" height=\"21\" />, then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/8/2285d8c5782cbb6137805c4e6539e7f8385e2c73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{20k+p}=\\frac{p(p+1)}{2} \\text{ mod } 10 = a_p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"244\" height=\"40\" /> \n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/7/9d7f8baf434b2959b713b5bc346a66d32737fc9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_n=a_1 + a_2 + a_3 + \\cdots + a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"226\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/a/35a9d0f147714bf222ae9fdca26c8eab71bb81d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{20k+p}=a_p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/6/e9602fc6c899c9b07c473ca9643de7334289ee43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{20k+p}=k\\sum_{i=1}^{20}a_i+\\sum_{i=1}^{p}a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"199\" height=\"55\" />\n</p><p>Now we calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e41f502f53d36016fb3cb8696ff305aa8dfbbd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/1/0c19d3b85e4bbabfb13c8cc043d719ccb74423d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{cases} a_{1}=\\frac{(1)(2)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=1\\text{ mod }10=1\\\\ a_{2}=\\frac{(2)(3)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=3\\text{ mod }10=3\\\\ a_{3}=\\frac{(3)(4)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=6\\text{ mod }10=6\\\\ a_{4}=\\frac{(4)(5)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=10\\text{ mod }10=0\\\\ a_{5}=\\frac{(5)(6)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=15\\text{ mod }10=5\\\\ a_{6}=\\frac{(6)(7)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=21\\text{ mod }10=1\\\\ a_{7}=\\frac{(7)(8)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=28\\text{ mod }10=8\\\\ a_{8}=\\frac{(8)(9)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=36\\text{ mod }10=6\\\\ a_{9}=\\frac{(9)(10)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=45\\text{ mod }10=5\\\\ a_{10}=\\frac{(10)(11)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=55\\text{ mod }10=5\\\\ a_{11}=\\frac{(11)(12)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=66\\text{ mod }10=6\\\\ a_{12}=\\frac{(12)(13)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=78\\text{ mod }10=8\\\\ a_{13}=\\frac{(13)(14)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=91\\text{ mod }10=1\\\\ a_{14}=\\frac{(14)(15)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=105\\text{ mod }10=5\\\\ a_{15}=\\frac{(15)(16)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=120\\text{ mod }10=0\\\\ a_{16}=\\frac{(16)(17)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=136\\text{ mod }10=6\\\\ a_{17}=\\frac{(17)(18)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=153\\text{ mod }10=3\\\\ a_{18}=\\frac{(18)(19)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=171\\text{ mod }10=1\\\\ a_{19}=\\frac{(19)(20)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=190\\text{ mod }10=0\\\\ a_{20}=\\frac{(20)(21)}{2}\\text{ mod }10=210\\text{ mod }10=0 \\end{cases}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -100px\" width=\"342\" height=\"492\" />\n</p><p>Using the table above we calculate: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/9/5d95d3b13aa1c05f047ebd65969ae9fc5681526d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i=1}^{20}a_i=70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"88\" height=\"55\" />,\n</p><p>Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f538b9910ccb021fa68bbcf42d73fab738da676a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{20k+p}=70k+\\sum_{i=1}^{p}a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"170\" height=\"54\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/6/ed6ca78591cc9ae2e72f7ab6525d7357809c1bb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{1992}=S_{(20)(99)+12}=(70)(99)+\\sum_{i=1}^{12}a_i=6930+\\sum_{i=1}^{12}a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"429\" height=\"55\" />\n</p><p>Using the table above we calculate: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/d/e1d7abb2434fb50930f60251f31dea93b661e61b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{i=1}^{12}a_i=54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"88\" height=\"55\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/8/8c80ee9a6c44557455f919381c7e563b6508e24a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{1992}=6930+54=6984$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"202\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/a/7aa9bb7f9c326477413d935daf74c0d76557cb9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 + a_2 + a_3 + \\cdots + a_{1992}=6984$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"261\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<ul><li>Note.  I actually competed at this event in Venezuela when I was in High School representing Puerto Rico.  Although I did get the correct answer, I was only given 8 out of 10 points because I didn't prove that the pattern repeats every 20 numbers.  I simply listed the calculations for the first 23 to 26 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1a2b6b7c193f9ba2b2134a59f1da5addcfbc98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" />'s and realized that the pattern repeated.  Without proof I proceeded to calculate 20 times 99 plus the summation from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/6/3f6bfb1f0a208187bed5a389462b7e45bb2a04c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"22\" height=\"10\" /> and despite getting the correct numerical answer, I was not awarded the full points for not sufficient proof.  At the competition showing that the pattern repeats every 20 by induction was not sufficient proof.  Whatever you claim, even if it is obvious, it needs to be proven.  I submitted such proof on this page.</li></ul>\n<p>~Tomas Diaz. orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p><p><i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1992_OIM_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_OIM_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OIM_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"OIM Problems and Solutions\">OIM Problems and Solutions</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe7.htm\">https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe7.htm</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017183433\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.139 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 160/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 344/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6889/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.576      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n100.00%    5.576      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26075:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017183433 and revision id 208219. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}